TYPE Prices
     Cod AS STRING * 4    'code
     Dis AS STRING * 10   'distributor
     Mdl AS STRING * 10   'model number
     Old AS STRING * 7    'old price
     New AS STRING * 7    'new price
     Dat AS STRING * 10   'date modified
     Par AS STRING * 3    'warranty parts
     Lab AS STRING * 3    'warranty labor
     Del AS STRING * 1    'delete marker
     Min AS STRING * 3    'minimum quantity
     Max AS STRING * 3    'maximum quantity
     Fil AS STRING * 9    'filler
     END TYPE

